# Commander Spock: "Whenever Commander Spock enters or attacks, reveal the top card of your library. ... If it's a land card, you
# may put it onto the battlefield tapped. If that card is still on top of your library, draw a card." As he enters the top card is
# an Island: Bot1 declines to put it onto the battlefield, so it is still on top and Bot1 draws it. On turn 3 he attacks, and the
# attack triggers the ability too: the Wasteland now on top is put onto the battlefield tapped, so nothing is drawn.

